# 18. Gunicorn Port Binding Considerations

## Problem

Running Gunicorn directly on port 80 can require elevated privileges and introduces security concerns.

## Solution

Used a cleaner architecture:

* Gunicorn bound to port 5000
* Application Load Balancer forwarded traffic
* Security Groups restricted direct access

Gunicorn configuration:

```bash
gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:5000 app:app
```

## What I Learned

* Production networking best practices
* Port management & security
* Load balancer traffic forwarding

